      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Morcego. Marcas em forma de coração nas paredes de uma caverna indicam que Woobat vive ali. Ele emite ondas ultrassônicas enquanto voa para localizar suas presas, principalmente Pokémon inseto.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 1/2 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Campo, Voador &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 50% M / 50% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 1/2</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Woobat pode evoluir para Swoobat no nível 6 ou superior e quando sua Lealdade for +2 ou maior. Quando evolui, seus pontos de vida aumentam no dobro do seu nível.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Confusion</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>2</td><td>Odor Sleuth</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>3</td><td>Gust</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>4</td><td>Assurance</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>5</td><td>Heart Stamp</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>7</td><td>Air Cutter, Imprison</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>9</td><td>Attract</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>10</td><td>Amnesia, Calm Mind</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>11</td><td>Air Slash</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>12</td><td>Future Sight</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>14</td><td>Psychic</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>15</td><td>Endeavor</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>16</td><td>Simple Beam</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>Acrobatics, Aerial Ace, After You, Air Slash, Ally Switch, Assurance, Attract, Calm Mind, Charge Beam, Charm, Confide, Defog, Double Team, Dream Eater, Dual Wingbeat, Embargo, Endeavor, Energy Ball, Expanding Force, Facade, Fake Tears, Fly, Frustration, Giga Drain, Gyro Ball, Heat Wave, Helping Hand, Hidden Power, Imprison, Knock Off, Light Screen, Magic Coat, Protect, Psych Up, Psychic, Psycho Cut, Psyshock, Rain Dance, Reflect, Rest, Return, Roost, Round, Safeguard, Shadow Ball, Shock Wave, Signal Beam, Skill Swap, Sleep Talk, Snore, Speed Swap, Steel Wing, Substitute, Super Fang, Swagger, Swift, Tailwind, Taunt, Telekinesis, Thief, Thunder Wave, Torment, Toxic, Trick, Trick Room, U- turn, Uproar, Zen Headbutt</p><h3>Egg Moves</h3><p>Captivate, Charm, Fake Tears, Flatter, Helping Hand, Knock Off, Psycho Shift, Roost, Stored Power, Supersonic, Synchronoise, Venom Drench</p>",
